It's a feature of how peacefulls act.  Tame monsters follow you
level to level out of loyalty.  Hostile monsters follow you level
to level to continue combat with you.  Peacefull monsters don't
care enough to follow you.  Spend so much time on a stash level
that a few peacefull unicorns are there and you will see that
happen consistantly.  It's a frustrating feature even when you
know about it and expect it.

When a dangerous former pet this feature has exactly the problem
you describe.  It's why folks tend to abandon dangerous pets in
a branch they will never visit against like Sokoban.  But they need
to do it while the monster is still a pet.  It also makes sense to
abandon pets on the way back up with the real Amulet if you have
more pets than you will be able to ascend with.


